            {
              "id": "1770003757211_1",
              "name": "returnValue",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.RETURN_INVALID_MESSAGE_STRING_RESPONSE.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "RETURN"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Date Fixer"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769597032286"
          },
          "code": "DATE_FIXER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769081413540",
          "id": "1769596967346",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769596967351_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Context\nYou are a Software Developer with expertise in Oracle SQL. There is an Human Resource Management System which has multiple processes such as Promotions, Change Salary, Termination etc. The employees submits Transactions that belong to these processes. These transactions go through an Approval Process before getting into effect. \n\n## Task\nYour job is to read the user input text and check if there are any dates that are provided in 'DD-MON-YYYY' format.\nIf any such instance if found then convert that date in respective 'YYYY-MM-DD' format and replace that in the same user query at same place.\nIf there are not mention of dates that are in  'DD-MON-YYYY' format then copy the input message as it is in the response.\n\n## Instructions\nDo not alter anyother text apart from date which matches the required format.\nDo not generated any explaination.\nDo not offer any suggestions in response.\n\n\n## Output Format\nPlain text\n\n## Example Scenario\nScenario 1: Show me the distribution of transactions with respect to each status that has assignees name like 'Meg Fitzimmons' and was submitted between 12-SEP-2025 and 24-OCT-2025 and belonging to process 'Additional Assignment Info'\nResponse: ```Show me the distribution of transactions with respect to each status that has assignees name like 'Meg Fitzimmons' and was submitted between 2025-09-12 and 2025-10-24 and belonging to process 'Additional Assignment Info''```\n\nScenario 2: Show me the distribution of Process names that were submitted after 22-NOV-2025\nResponse:```Show me the distribution of Process names that were submitted after 2025-11-22```\n\nScenario 3: Show me the distribution of transactions for each status that are submitted between 2025-12-03 and 2025-12-10\nResponse:```Show me the distribution of transactions for each status that are submitted between 2025-12-03 and 2025-12-10```\n\n\n##scenario\n {{$context.$variables.userScenario}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "modify user input"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769081540460"
          },
          "code": "MODIFY_USER_INPUT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1769081413540",
          "id": "1769597032286",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769597044799",
              "name": "userScenario",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
